      "data": {
        "label": "EXAMPLE — Customer Journey: Booking a Ticket\n\nIllustrates: edges-as-sequence rather than hierarchy — a business architect (or a PO, this isn't architect-exclusive) walking through the passenger's experience end to end, not a system diagram. Deliberately the \"simple\" pick of the gallery's starting trio: one straight line of steps, no containers, no linking, no highlights.\n\nPersona: a business architect on Meridian Rail's modernization task force, mapping the current passenger experience.\n\nPart of the Meridian Rail example gallery — epic 0022 (docs/planning/epics/0022-example-diagram-gallery.md)."
      }
    },
